# Files whose exact bytes are checked by SHA-256 must never have their line endings converted on checkout
# (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which turns LF into CRLF and breaks the check):
#   - extraction_reviews/: a validation record fixes the hash of validated_text.md (docs/EXTRACTION_REVIEW.md);
#   - sample_corpus/: an Eligible approval fixes the hash of the reviewed file (patch 0023, recipe G).
# tests/test_setup_guards.py checks these rules.
packages/orchestrator/extraction_reviews/** -text
packages/orchestrator/sample_corpus/** -text

*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
